sequenceDiagram
    %% starting a GitHub link for a domain
    actor owner as Owner
    participant fluid as Fluid
    participant rest as REST API
    participant gh as GitHub
    participant state as Origin state
    owner->>fluid: Link to GitHub
    fluid->>rest: POST link start
    rest->>gh: device code
    gh-->>rest: user code
    rest-->>fluid: user code
    fluid-->>owner: Show the code
    par the person confirms
        owner->>gh: enter the code
    and the server polls
        loop until confirmed or expired
            rest->>gh: poll
            gh-->>rest: pending
        end
    end
    gh-->>rest: token
    rest->>state: remember the origin
